                 <h2><strong>Pro Performance with A20 Pro and Advanced&nbsp;Thermal&nbsp;Management</strong>
</h2>
                 
             
                 <div>Powered by A20 Pro — the same chip in iPhone 18 Pro models — and paired with an advanced thermal management system, iPhone Duo delivers up to 35 percent better sustained performance than iPhone 17 Pro. A new chip package inspired by M-series Apple silicon connects A20 Pro directly to a custom vapor chamber, dissipating heat and powering multitasking, gaming, and complex AI workloads. A new display engine drives the inner and outer displays simultaneously and enables a fluid experience as users transition between them. The 6-core CPU is up to 20 percent faster than A19 Pro, delivering the fastest CPU in a smartphone; the 7-core GPU is up to 40 percent faster and more power efficient; and the new Dual 16-core Neural Engine offers 2x the compute power to run on-device AI models. A20 Pro also delivers 50 percent more unified memory bandwidth and is built on the latest 2-nanometer process technology.
</div>
                 
             
         </div>
 

    
    
    


    
    <div data-component-list="ScrollAnimationDefault AutoPlayVideo">
        <div>With a new chip package, A20 Pro on iPhone Duo can reach peak performance for on-device AI immediately, and the vapor chamber sustains it for high-frame-rate gaming and multitasking on the large display.</div>
        
            <a aria-label="Download video: A20 Pro with Custom Vapor Chamber" data-analytics-title="Download video - A20 Pro with Custom Vapor Chamber" download="" href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/videos/2026/autoplay/09/apple-unveils-iphone-duo/apple-iphone-duo-a20-pro-and-custom-vapor-chamber/downloads/Apple-iPhone-Duo-A20-Pro-and-custom-vapor-chamber-260909.zip">
            </a>
        
    </div>






    
    
    


     
     
    
    
        <div>
             
                 <h2><strong>Impressive All-Day Battery Life</strong>
</h2>
                 
             
                 <div>iPhone Duo is designed with one high-energy battery on each side to maximize capacity while efficiently using internal space. A combination of Apple silicon and energy rebalancing algorithms allows the batteries to operate seamlessly as one, so users get up to 31 hours of video playback when using the inner display, up to 44 hours of video playback when using the outer display, and up to 24 hours of usage per charge when both displays are used equally.<sup>7</sup> Users can also enjoy fast charging — iPhone Duo can charge up to 50 percent in around 20 minutes or wirelessly charge up to 50 percent in around 30 minutes with a MagSafe or Qi2 charger.<sup>8</sup>
</div>
                 
             
                 <h2><strong>Powerful Wireless Capabilities</strong>
</h2>
                 
             
                 <div>iPhone Duo features an eSIM-only design worldwide that saves internal space to maximize battery capacity.<sup>9</sup> eSIM offers greater flexibility, better security, and seamless connectivity compared to traditional physical SIM cards, and as an industry standard, it is supported by over 500 carriers around the world, including AT&amp;T, T-Mobile, Verizon, and more. iOS 27 also introduces iPhone Handoff, which allows users with supported carriers to easily switch back and forth between two iPhone models with the same phone number.<sup>10</sup>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div>N1, an Apple-designed wireless networking chip, enables Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 6, and Thread, while C2, Apple’s next-generation cellular modem system, brings AI-powered improvements to cellular quality and reliability, and now supports mmWave in the U.S.
</div>
                 
             
                 <h2><strong>Beautiful New Accessories</strong>
</h2>
                 
             
                 <div>To complement iPhone Duo, Apple is introducing beautiful new accessories. The iPhone Duo Folio — available in navy blue and taupe — features an integrated kickstand that supports a wide range of angles for reading, viewing content, or FaceTime, and folds away neatly when not in use. The iPhone Duo Case — available in sand and navy blue — is thin and light, with a protective two-part design that wraps around both sides of the device. Both cases are compatible with MagSafe, Qi2 25W, and Qi-certified chargers. With built-in magnets that align perfectly with iPhone Duo, they offer a magical attach experience and fast wireless charging.
</div>
                 
             
         </div>
 

    
    
    


    
    
        
        
        
