						</picture>
						
					</div>
					<div data-staggered-item="">
							<h3>
								<span>Power coupled.</span>
							</h3>
							<p>An iPhone-first <strong>dual-battery system</strong>, along with an internal space-saving eSIM design<sup data-footnote="numbered-esim"><a href="#footnote-9" aria-label="Footnote 6" data-modal-close="">6</a></sup>, maximizes physical space for battery capacity. And the C2 modem delivers groundbreaking efficiency. So even if you’re scrolling and gaming throughout the day, iPhone Duo can go the distance on a single charge<sup data-footnote="numbered-battery"><a href="#footnote-4" aria-label="Footnote 1" data-modal-close="">1</a></sup>. And you’ll get up to 50 percent charge in around 20 minutes with fast wired charging<sup data-footnote="numbered-fast-wired-charging"><a href="#footnote-10" aria-label="Footnote 7" data-modal-close="">7</a></sup>.</p>
